---
version: 2.0.2
title: enum value and runtime clash
---
-- schema.sql ------------------------------------------------------------------

create type event_kind as enum ('date', 'meeting');
create table events (id serial primary key, kind event_kind not null);

-- queries.sql -----------------------------------------------------------------

-- name: GetEvents :many
select kind from events;

-- error -----------------------------------------------------------------------

`Date` would be defined twice in the generated module, by parrot's own code and by value 'date' of enum 'event_kind'. Parrot can not generate this name yet, please open an issue: https://github.com/daniellionel01/parrot/issues
